    <!--
        LSPosed module load scope (xposedscope): any package a user can enable in
        the app must appear here, or LSPosed never loads the module into that
        process. com.catsmoker.app is intentionally listed so the module runs in
        the app process and can detect itself (isModuleActive).

        This is the only array in the file. Per-game metadata lives in Kotlin â€”
        EditGameFilesViewModel.initializeGameConfigs and GameType â€” so there is
        nothing here to keep index-synchronised with anything else.
    -->
